  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ctxrs/ctx/zipball/v2.4.1",
  "body": "Released: 2026-11-05\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Broad multi-word searches run about 40 to 50 percent faster on large histories and return the same best matches.\n- While background indexing catches Blame up with newer history, Blame tells you to check `ctx status` and retry instead of starting another full import.\n- Retrying an interrupted search index rebuild removes abandoned build files before starting again, while keeping searchable history and files still in use.\n- `ctx status` no longer briefly reports a stale daemon lock while the daemon is starting or updating it.\n- Importing a folder with `--path` keeps healthy sessions when a neighboring file can't be read, and reports the problem file. This covers Pi, Claude Code, Codex and Prime Agent. Pi also skips files that aren't sessions and symlinks.\n- Cline SDK imports keep previously imported sessions and report a failure when a session catalog can't be read.\n\n- Source commit: [33ba4645b620fd89d138c6db1fabf33096a0ee16](https://github.com/ctxrs/ctx/commit/33ba4645b620fd89d138c6db1fabf33096a0ee16)\n"
}
